  "reviewer_note": "Least sure: the departure day (27 December per Darwin Online and the museum; 10 December per CITiZAN). Where Darwin Online gives a date range for a port, the waypoint year is its first day. Darwin Online has no Cape Town entry, only the Cape of Good Hope. No Darwin or Galápagos record exists yet to link.",
